     "<span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Hello!</span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">I have fitted the tree detectability models to a dataset of visual records of resplendent quetzals in sampling transects in Guatemala. I want to extract detectability values and other values from the uniform model using the command summarize_ds_models(BQ.uni, output=&quot;plain&quot;). However, I&#39;m getting this error: &gt; summarize_ds_models(BQ.uni, output=&quot;plain&quot;) Error in </span><span style=\"border:0px solid rgb(227,227,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-size:0.875em;color:rgb(13,13,13);font-weight:600;font-family:&quot;S\\0000f6hne Mono&quot;,Monaco,&quot;Andale Mono&quot;,&quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;,monospace\">[.data.frame</span><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">(res, , 4:7) : undefined columns selected. </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Could you help me resolve it?</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\">Thanks a lot!!</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(13,13,13);font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px\"><br></span></div>"
